                                                "sense_id": "f04710c4-65de-3783-808f-4a55858a10f2",
                                                "text": "perform all those works of mercy, which Clemens Alexandrinus calls amoris et amicitiæ impletionem et extentionem, the extent and complement of love[…]."
                                            }
